OL,3,CBritish mum latest to die from Spanish
OL,4,Cwildfires, as death toll hits 14
OL,6,FA British woman has died in hospital
OL,7,Fafter she was caught in a devastating
OL,8,Fwildfire in Spain in July, bringing
OL,9,Fthe total death toll to 14.
OL,11,FThe blaze scorched around 35 square
OL,12,Fmiles of forest and farmland in Los
OL,13,FGallardos, southern Spain, killing 12
OL,14,Fpeople, including six Brits.
OL,16,FIt is one of the deadliest wildfires
OL,17,Fin Spain's history.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/5
