OL,3,CBritish mum latest to die from Spanish
OL,4,Cwildfires, as death toll hits 14
OL,6,FLisa Fryett died in hospital on July
OL,7,F28 from injuries she sustained in the
OL,8,Ffire, making her the eighth Brit
OL,9,Fkilled by the blaze.
OL,11,FA 93-year-old British woman, who has
OL,12,Fnot been named, also died in hospital.
OL,14,FMs Fryett and her husband Simon
OL,15,FBatchelor, from Essex, were staying
OL,16,Fnear Bedar, Los Gallardos, when the
OL,17,Fhuge wildfire swept through the area.
OL,19,FThe couple were rescued and taken to
OL,20,Fhospital, but were in a critical
OL,21,Fcondition.
OL,26,@xD@Grr
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/5
