FL,319,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1785975492
OL,3,CBritish mum latest to die from Spanish
OL,4,Cwildfires, as death toll hits 14
OL,6,FTheir family set up a GoFundMe to
OL,7,Fraise money towards insurance and
OL,8,Fhealthcare costs, but they later
OL,9,Fconfirmed Ms Fryett had passed away.
OL,11,FThey said she was surrounded by
OL,12,Ffamily, including their three children.
OL,14,FHer son Alfie Batchelor wrote on
OL,15,FFacebook: "Words genuinely can't
OL,16,Fdescribe how upset I am right now
OL,17,Fwriting this. It doesn't feel real
OL,18,Fstill but yesterday 28/07/2026 we said
OL,19,Fgoodbye to my beautiful mum."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/5
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
