CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1785975492
OL,3,CBritish mum latest to die from Spanish
OL,4,Cwildfires, as death toll hits 14
OL,6,FMia Witt, a relative who organised the
OL,7,Ffundraiser, said: "Our hearts are
OL,8,Fcompletely broken, and there are
OL,9,Fsimply no words to describe the pain
OL,10,Fwe are feeling.
OL,12,F"Lisa fought so incredibly hard, and
OL,13,Fwe are so grateful that her loved ones
OL,14,Fwere able to be by her side,
OL,15,Fsurrounding her with love until the
OL,16,Fvery end."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/5
